OL,3,A'I didn't speak the Queen's English':
OL,4,AWhy people worry about their accents
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrowing up in Manchester, Mia Tanswell
OL,7,Fdidn't give her accent much thought -
OL,8,Funtil her first week at university in
OL,9,FLoughborough.
OL,11,F"I knew people were going to notice
OL,12,Fthat I was northern and that I didn't
OL,13,Fspeak the 'Queen's English'," the
OL,14,F22-year-old says.
OL,16,F"Definitely in seminars I would
OL,17,Fsometimes feel like my accent would
OL,18,Fsound a bit less intellectual than
OL,19,Fother people, especially if I was the
OL,20,Fonly northern student in the
OL,21,Fclassroom."
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
